# recognition proposes, it does not machine.

# F3: pocket floor at z=20.0; vertical wall loop F4 F6, mouth at z=30.0, depth 10.0, opens upward; 1 inner wire -- standing material inside the pocket proposes beside it; open along F1 (the blank's silhouette, drawn 0.02 past it); the edge along the rim of F7 is a wall the Clear rides to (a void proposed beside it) (CHECKLIST row 2.7)
# consume with: run Clear(tool=..., profile=F3_Pocket, stepover=...)  [the feature carries its own z + extent]
# or finish with: run Side(tool=..., surface=F3_Pocket, comp=control)
# comp=control is required on recognized profile Side runs: recognized boundaries carry rounded
# corners tessellated to chords, and engine comp hard-errors on rounded-corner
# offsets (DECISIONS.md -> "recognized contours propose comp=control")
# open along F1: the part's silhouette, drawn 0.02 past the blank --
# the engine clips the outline to the declared stock, so on a `stock Cylinder` of the
# part's diameter those edges read OPEN, and on a larger Box they read WALL
# this floor has 1 inner wire: a boss proposed INSIDE this loop is its island, derived from
# containment -- the Clear above goes around it (stepover at most the tool's radius), and the
# island takes no Clear of its own. CHECK that every inner wire has a proposed boss below:
# standing material this reader could not name is NOT in the proposal, and would be cleared through.
